# `EMBED-01` (ADR-0029 decision 8): the host's first timer. It fires a minute after the last look ended, so a long round (the encoder runs for
# hours) is never overlapped, and every look writes the heartbeat the worker checks before it opens a window. The window's hours are the
# worker's (the setting `vector_window`), not this timer's: the timer only looks. Disable it to stop the night encoder; the intents wait.
[Unit]
Description=AuditManager night encoder: look every minute (EMBED-01)

[Timer]
OnBootSec=2min
OnUnitInactiveSec=1min
AccuracySec=10s
Persistent=false

[Install]
WantedBy=timers.target
